{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120140058454-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120163947\"/><p>現場為深水埗運動場對開一地盤。</p><p>深水埗發現懷疑炸彈。今午(20日)12時58分，興華街3號深水埗運動場對開一地盤的工人報案，指在上址發現酒樽型的懷疑爆炸品。警員接報到場，發現一件長約30厘米的可疑金屬物，隨即封鎖現場。相關物品其後由爆炸品處理人員檢走，現場亦安全解封。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.592829+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:18.689173+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:18.689173+00:00","content_hash":"84e34533837c48f8c7dbcbcd4a42825a8cd0cdff0d1e76ccaf38ba794a91e1eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}